  "paragraph": 21,
  "text": "The solution used by harnesses like Manus and top coding agents is remarkably simple: treat the workspace disk as durable external memory. Manus popularized keeping a live todo file and continuously updating workspace artifacts so goals stay fresh in attention. Coding harnesses pair structured JSON checklists with concise progress notes, choosing JSON over freeform Markdown because models are far less likely to corrupt structured schemas. Combined with clean git commits after each milestone, any fresh session can read those files and orient itself in seconds.",
